  "findings": [
    "Worker count GOMAXPROCS-2 can become zero/nonpositive, leaving nonempty work channel with no consumers. Static source finding, not reproduced.",
    "Error accumulator goroutine is not joined before returning err; result collection completion alone does not synchronize accumulator completion.",
    "Duplicates skips previously selected roots but does not filter found members already used in other groups; overlap/count semantics require tree inspection and runtime validation.",
    "DCT uses coefficient coordinates1..8 in both axes, not usual0..7block with only DC excluded; distinct preprocessing contract.",
    "Perceptual thresholds10/22 heuristics, comments admit nonduplicates at18..20. No calibration proof.",
    "Six hash tests cover five Hamming properties/examples and uniform-white dHash; no DCT fixture or image accuracy test."
  ],
  "remaining": [],
  "previous_audit": "docs/research/dedup-500/godedupe221-source-review-v5-20261024.json",
  "tree_io_review": {
    "execution": false,
    "observations": [
      "Within uses strict distance<radius; zero threshold excludes even identical hashes. Max-heap emits farthest-first, not closest-first.",
      "Tree build partitions around distance to arbitrary midpoint item, not median-selected distance; no guaranteed balancing. Identical hashes can create deeply skewed recursion.",
      "File IDs assigned under mutex in worker completion order; randomized tree roots and grouping traversal can affect reproducibility.",
      "FindImages discards WalkDir returned error; missing/inaccessible traversal can look like empty/partial success.",
      "Extension matching case-sensitive jpg/jpeg/png; GIF decoder registered but scanner excludes.gif.",
      "CopyFiles creates hard links, not independent copies; MoveFiles uses basename destination without explicit overwrite prevention or preflight. Functions reviewed, never executed.",
      "No byte comparison, source identity/mutation check, cancellation or image dimension budget visible in these helpers."
    ]
  },
  "cli_tests_review": {
    "execution": false,
    "observations": [
      "VPtree test compares2568bit values to exhaustive strict-radius reference for one random target/threshold; useful finite oracle, no run performed.",
      "No original mutation/overlapping-group/cancellation tests in reviewed3additional test files.",
      "Compare-mode result group excludes target; delete branch keeps first matched result and deletes only remaining matches when deleteAll false. Thus survivor choice does not simply mean preserve target and remove all matches.",
      "delete-all flag alone does not enter delete branch, which is gated on delete flag.",
      "CLI continues to mutation phase even when dedup returned an error and some groups; no source revalidation or byte confirmation. Source-only observation; no mutation executed.",
      "stdin splits paths on spaces and ignores Scanner.Err; output Flush error not checked.",
      "quiet/output redirect opens os.DevNull read-only using os.Open, while subsequent writes errors ignored.",
      "Invalid hash option logs and falls backDCT rather than failing; zero/negative threshold ignored."
    ]
  },
